sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Development as development
    participant Feature as feature/*
    participant Preview as preview
    participant QA as QA/Client

    Dev->>Development: branch from stable integration
    Development->>Feature: create feature/*
    Dev->>Feature: commit changes
    Feature->>Preview: merge for validation
    Preview->>QA: deploy preview environment
    QA-->>Dev: approve or request changes
    alt Approved
        Feature->>Development: merge accepted feature
    else Changes requested
        Dev->>Feature: update same feature branch
        Feature->>Preview: merge updated feature for validation
    end
    Note over Preview,Development: preview MUST NOT merge into development
